Fixed 2026-08-05 (round 15): convert_function_template unifies
signature-equivalent declarations across parameter spellings
(equivalence includes return type, method cv-qualifiers, and
constraints -- the const/non-const _M_access pair and the
concept-subsumption overloads stay distinct); friend function
templates are recorded in C_friends and the access check accepts
their specializations via the instance's ID_C_template link.
